            Backend server configuration 
 
1. Update System & Install Build Dependencies for Python  
sudo apt update 
sudo apt install -y software-properties-common build-essential \ 
                    libssl-dev libffi-dev zlib1g-dev \ 
                    libbz2-dev libreadline-dev libsqlite3-dev \ 
                    libmysqlclient-dev default-libmysqlclient-dev 
sudo apt install pkg-config 
These are required to build and run Python packages, not to change OS Python. 
 
2. Add Deadsnakes PPA (Safe for Side-by-Side Python) 
sudo add-apt-repository ppa:deadsnakes/ppa -y 
sudo apt update 
This PPA allows multiple Python versions to coexist. 
 
3. Install Python 3.8 (Without Changing Default) 
sudo apt install -y python3.8 python3.8-venv python3.8-dev 
Verify: 
python3.8 --version 
 
